      "Anchor": "module-1---authentication",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Upon completing development, to ensure official certification of Module 1, please review each of the test cases mentioned below. To ensure an efficient meeting, please review all appropriate documentation and send technical questions to your Business Development and/or Partner Engineering representative beforehand.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
